  "extractionNotes": "Employee hired by a limited company on 2025-11-03, about ten weeks before the birth on 2026-01-13; monthly pay 1273.49; the Z-3 working-time entry is ambiguous (possibly one eighth of full time) and is omitted. No sick leave before the birth. Claim: maternity 2026-01-13..2026-06-01 and parental 2026-06-02..2027-01-11 at 81.5% (explicit leave request, father's statement of non-use), application date on the Z-3 2026-01-20. ZUS opened insurance proceedings on 2026-02-09 and decided that she was not compulsorily insured as the payer's employee from 2025-11-03 (sham contract: USUS art. 83, 68, 6, 11, 12, 13 with KC art. 83 and KP art. 300); only the first page of that decision is in the file. The file opens with the cover of the decision refusing maternity benefit; its text and period are not in the file, so the refused periods are the claim. asOf = date the proceedings were opened (decisions undated in the scan). Variant: without the non-coverage decision the title stands and the claim is granted; the risk alert must fire either way (new title shortly before the birth, low pay, small company)."
